{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：09:10 2026-08-22 HKT</p>\n\n<p>西環第三街163號廣豐臺一座，今（22日）早上7時33分，一名女子由高處墮下，倒臥平台，救護員接報到場，經檢驗後證實女事主當場死亡。警員用帳篷遮蓋遺體，經調查後獲悉死者姓潘(47歲)，為上址住客。</p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9f37dc2bb074de1bf388c9d059afa0d9/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_09_02_41_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場調查。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3fb554fe0a6a17ad94bc19c8723a3851/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_09_02_41.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子墮下倒臥平台當場不治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3f7296f2ee3e8d0ea46936e807b23f4c/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_09_02_40_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"女子墮下倒臥平台當場不治。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6dfb295d69aaf8a177d27c65e7928fc8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_09_02_40_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"遺體由帳篷遮蓋。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0497858fd5ccb9ad5488b8dd13d979df/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-22_at_09_02_39.jpeg\"/>\n<p>據悉，事主過去兩個月感身體不適，無法安睡，惟她沒有就醫。警方在其住所檢獲遺書，透露因生活不快而萌死念。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-22T06:40:21.006362+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":176,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}